              <chunks count="1">
                <chunk name="Container">
                  <items count="6">
                    <item name="Description" type_name="gh_string" type_code="10">Returns the center of geometry and the Diameter of its bounding box as the Dimension. Right-click to choose options.
[ForAll]:  option to have the center point of a group of geometries.
And for the position:
[Spacial]: Spacial Domain Center. 
[Planar]: Projected the center on XY Plane. 
[Basement]:  Center of the basement Plane</item>
                    <item name="Hidden" type_name="gh_bool" type_code="1">true</item>
